<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank o/n widen, one-week steady.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank o/n widen, one-week steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The range of overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound widened on Monday in a moderately liquid private sector market to between 6-1/2 and eight percent from Sunday's range of between 7-7/8 and 8-1/2 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rate ranges were unchanged at between eight and 8-1/2.</p>
<p>Bankers said that public sector banks kept their official minimum lending rate steady at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>($1=3.395 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
